{"title":"What should I ask Helen Castor?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/915226061/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Helen-Castor.html","date":1742545217000,"content":"<p>Yes I will be doing a Conversation with her.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helen_Castor\" target=\"_blank\">Wikipedia</a>:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p><b>Helen Ruth Castor</b> <span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fellow_of_the_Royal_Society_of_Literature\">FRSL</a></span> (born 4 August 1968) is a British historian of the medieval and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/House_of_Tudor\">Tudor</a> period and a BBC broadcaster. She taught history at the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/University_of_Cambridge\">University of Cambridge</a> and is the author of books including <i><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blood_and_Roses_(book)\">Blood and Roses</a></i> (2004) and <i>She-Wolves: The Women Who Ruled England Before Elizabeth</i> (2010). Programmes she has presented include <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BBC_Radio_4\">BBC Radio 4</a>‘s <i>Making History</i> and <i>She-Wolves</i> on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BBC_Four\">BBC Four</a>. Her most recent book is <i><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=The_Eagle_and_the_Hart:_The_Tragedy_of_Richard_II_and_Henry_IV&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\">The Eagle and the Hart: The Tragedy of Richard II and Henry IV</a></i> (2024).</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>I very much liked her last book in particular.  And here is<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.theguardian.com/books/2024/oct/12/historian-helen-castor-id-rather-not-live-in-such-interesting-times-the-eagle-and-hart-tragedy-of-richard-ii-and-henry-iv\" target=\"_blank\"> a good interview with her</a>.  So what should I ask her?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/what-should-i-ask-helen-castor.html\">What should I ask Helen Castor?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/915226061/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/915226061/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/915226061/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/915226061/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/915226061/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/915226061/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/what-should-i-ask-helen-castor.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/what-should-i-ask-helen-castor.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/what-should-i-ask-helen-castor.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/what-should-i-ask-helen-castor.html#comment-160890797\">I should first mention that I am a former student of Helen's at ...</a> <i>by David</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/what-should-i-ask-helen-castor.html#comment-160890746\">First, the fight for the English throne begins with the death ...</a> <i>by JA</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/what-should-i-ask-helen-castor.html#comment-160890720\">In the late middle ages, did England have more female rulers ...</a> <i>by Femm</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/what-should-i-ask-helen-castor.html#comment-160890704\">What’s an unusual book — perhaps unrelated to history — ...</a> <i>by John Smith</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/what-should-i-ask-helen-castor.html#comment-160890637\">Why can't we build beautiful castles anymore?</a> <i>by C</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/what-should-i-ask-helen-castor.html#comments\">Plus 10 more...</a></li></ul></div><h3>Related Stories</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/some-history-of-higher-education.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=some-history-of-higher-education\">Some history of higher education</a></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/why-spains-transition-to-democracy-remains-controversial.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=why-spains-transition-to-democracy-remains-controversial\">Why Spain’s transition to democracy remains controversial</a></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/my-excellent-conversation-with-ezra-klein.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=r